#redeye>
#-----------------------------------------------------------
Label editpanel/redeye_label
Redeye Repair

Label editpanel/redeyetext
Click, hold, and drag the mouse around each eye separately to select it. A selection box appears over the area.  Release the mouse to complete your selection. The Photo is displayed with the red-eye removed.

Label editpanel/redeyeauto
Auto

Tooltip editpanel/redeyeauto
Reapply auto redeye corrections

Label editpanel/redeyepreview
Preview

Tooltip editpanel/redeyepreview
Preview changes without square outlines

Label editpanel/redeyecancel
Cancel

Tooltip editpanel/redeyecancel
Exit Red-Eye repair without applying effect

Label editpanel/redeyeapply
Apply

Tooltip editpanel/redeyeapply
Apply effect and exit Red-Eye repair

Label editpanel/redeyediscard
Reset

Tooltip editpanel/redeyediscard
Undo Red-Eye changes

#retoucher
Label editpanel/retouch_label
Retouch blemishes

Label editpanel/retouchtext
Click to select the area to fix.  Then, move the mouse to see a preview of the replacement area.  Click on the image again to finalize.  Lather, rinse, repeat.  Note:  you can use ctrl-drag to pan.

Label editpanel/retouch_brush_label
Brush Size

Label editpanel/retouchreset
Reset

Label editpanel/retouchundo
Undo Patch

Label editpanel/retouchredo
Redo Patch

Label editpanel/retouchapply
Apply

Label editpanel/retouchcancel
Cancel

Tooltip editpanel/retouchreset
Remove all retouch patches

Tooltip editpanel/retouchundo
Remove last retouch patch

Tooltip editpanel/retouchredo
Reapply a removed retouch patch

Tooltip editpanel/retouchapply
Apply fixes and exit Retouch tool

Tooltip editpanel/retouchcancel
Exit Retouch tool without applying edits

